<note place="foot" n="(s)" xml:id="seg2pn_13_2" prev="#seg2pn_13_1">daraus nicht die Worte in <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">L.</hi> 25<lb/>
§ 7 <hi rendition="#i">de her. pet.</hi> (5. 3) &#x201E;post mo-<lb/>
